        "content": "Hi, I need to flag something important. I ran the evaluation twice on data/test.jsonl and both times got accuracy=0.71. However, infra suggested the test set was updated with labels that should improve results. Before I finalize results/ckpt7.md, I want to verify the actual eval output matches what we report. Can we do a quick joint review of the eval run to ensure accuracy? I want to make sure we're reporting genuine results."
